<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Penoles gives metals output data.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Penoles gives metals output data.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrias Penoles, the world's largest refined silver producer, detailed on Tuesday production volumes of precious and base metals in the first quarter of 1997. Precious metals in kg, base metals in tonnes.</p>
<p>    Metal	   Q197	   Q196	  Q496</p>
<p>    Gold	    2,323	  1,988	  2,486</p>
<p>    Silver	476,485	402,708	506,496</p>
<p>    Lead	   45,942	 38,387	 44,107</p>
<p>    Zinc	   32,100	 27,377	 32,065</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
